  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "note0",
      "type": "NoteNode",
      "x": 90,
      "y": 224,
      "init": {
        "label": "Tasks: list and tracked time",
        "body": "# The same tasks, from the files and from the plugin\n\nA tasks folder read as a **Vault Folder** already gives each task's title, status, priority, due and tags: they are frontmatter, straight from the files. **TaskNotes** is for what lives only in the plugin. Here it sums each task's timeEntries into minutes tracked, a total the files can't give you.\n\nThe third group scores the unfinished tasks through a **Decision Matrix**: a short estimate and time already tracked both count (a negative weight means lower is better), every task gets a score, and the podium is the answer.\n\nWith no vault folder or TaskNotes URL set in Settings, both readers use the bundled sample, so this runs anywhere.",
        "color": "violet",
        "width": 430,
        "height": 190
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "vfLive",
      "type": "VaultFolderNode",
      "x": 21,
      "y": 510,
      "init": {
        "label": "Vault Folder",
        "folder": "Tasks"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "listDisplay",
